<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it lowered its recommendation on Unocal Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 to 41-3/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
